<title>LATVIA: LATVIAN WEEKEND SOCCER RESULTS/STANDINGS.</title>
<headline>LATVIAN WEEKEND SOCCER RESULTS/STANDINGS.</headline>
<dateline>RIGA 1997-05-05</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following are the results of</p>
<p>Latvia's soccer championship at the weekend plus the current</p>
<p>standings:</p>
<p>Baltika/Metalurgs 3-0 Ventspils</p>
<p>    Universitate	0-3 Skonto</p>
<p>    Daugava	     0-0 Rezekne</p>
<p>    STANDINGS	P  W  D  L  F  A  Pts</p>
<p>    Skonto	   3  3  0  0  10 0  9</p>
<p>    Baltika	  4  2  2  0  4  0  8</p>
<p>    Daugava	  3  2  1  0  4  0  7</p>
<p>    Ventspils	4  2  0  2  3  6  6</p>
<p>    Lokomotive     3  1  0  2  6  6  3</p>
<p>    FK Valmiera    3  1  0  2  3  4  3</p>
<p>    Universitate   4  1  0  3  3  8  3</p>
<p>    FK Rezekne     4  0  2  2  1  9  2</p>
<p>    Dinaburga	2  0  1  1  0  1  1</p>
<p>-- Riga newsroom, +371 721 5240</p>
